{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf7a BEARDS &amp; BREWED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beards, brews, and a warm medieval tavern tale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beards &amp; Brewed</strong> is a cozy, medieval-themed co-op tavern management game for 1\u20135 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, players work to keep a small tavern alive:<br>preparing food, serving drinks, keeping customers happy,<br>and steadily improving their tavern day by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Just teamwork, warmth, and good company. \ud83c\udf7b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf57 <strong>COZY CO-OP TAVERN GAMEPLAY</strong><br>\u2022 Play together with 1\u20135 players<br>\u2022 Take on any role you like: cook, serve, organize<br>\u2022 Work toward a shared goal in the same tavern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7a <strong>A DAY IN THE TAVERN</strong><br><strong>Each day:</strong><br>\u2022 Prepare meals<br>\u2022 Serve drinks<br>\u2022 Satisfy customers<br>\u2022 Collect your daily earnings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each night, the future of the tavern is decided.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f <strong>PROGRESSION BY VOTING</strong><br><strong>At the end of the day, players vote together:</strong><br>\u2022 Which upgrade to choose<br>\u2022 New equipment or better recipes?<br>\u2022 More tables or a faster kitchen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices are permanent and shape the identity of your tavern.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>GROWING TAVERN &amp; RENT SYSTEM</strong><br>\u2022 Rent must be paid every few days<br>\u2022 As food, drinks, and customers increase, so does the challenge<br>\u2022 Grow carefully and keep your tavern balanced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>MEDIEVAL ATMOSPHERE</strong><br>\u2022 Candlelight<br>\u2022 Wooden tables<br>\u2022 Fireplace crackles<br>\u2022 Bearded patrons<br>\u2022 A warm and welcoming tavern vibe</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086670?t=1773848466","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/7967cc487d2904927cf08f4d9b775a4a8c7fe6db/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773848466","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/96e394fcdb903e442216d8ee24a82a34d37f0ed6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773848466","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/96e394fcdb903e442216d8ee24a82a34d37f0ed6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773848466","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf7a BEARDS &amp; BREWED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beards, brews, and a warm medieval tavern tale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beards &amp; Brewed</strong> is a cozy, medieval-themed co-op tavern management game for 1\u20135 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, players work to keep a small tavern alive:<br>preparing food, serving drinks, keeping customers happy,<br>and steadily improving their tavern day by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Just teamwork, warmth, and good company. \ud83c\udf7b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf57 <strong>COZY CO-OP TAVERN GAMEPLAY</strong><br>\u2022 Play together with 1\u20135 players<br>\u2022 Take on any role you like: cook, serve, organize<br>\u2022 Work toward a shared goal in the same tavern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7a <strong>A DAY IN THE TAVERN</strong><br><strong>Each day:</strong><br>\u2022 Prepare meals<br>\u2022 Serve drinks<br>\u2022 Satisfy customers<br>\u2022 Collect your daily earnings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each night, the future of the tavern is decided.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f <strong>PROGRESSION BY VOTING</strong><br><strong>At the end of the day, players vote together:</strong><br>\u2022 Which upgrade to choose<br>\u2022 New equipment or better recipes?<br>\u2022 More tables or a faster kitchen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices are permanent and shape the identity of your tavern.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>GROWING TAVERN &amp; RENT SYSTEM</strong><br>\u2022 Rent must be paid every few days<br>\u2022 As food, drinks, and customers increase, so does the challenge<br>\u2022 Grow carefully and keep your tavern balanced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>MEDIEVAL ATMOSPHERE</strong><br>\u2022 Candlelight<br>\u2022 Wooden tables<br>\u2022 Fireplace crackles<br>\u2022 Bearded patrons<br>\u2022 A warm and welcoming tavern vibe</p>","developers":["TadolakDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/97b96349c4b7eebe180f473e03e8e8ddcfe02013/header.jpg?t=1773848466","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086670/2075968850/99e34c029c4d53bb5a7293dbd4fa718185947b7a/1772068264/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772069192","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086670/2075968850/99e34c029c4d53bb5a7293dbd4fa718185947b7a/1772068264/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772069192","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086670/2075968